00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:19.103
&gt;&gt; Well, first I would like to thank
Stanford for giving me this great honor.

00:12:19.103 --> 00:12:24.072
I never thought I can have
the privilege to get this award.

00:12:24.072 --> 00:12:28.884
Remember 20 years ago when
Seattle discovered Internet, and

00:12:28.884 --> 00:12:33.353
19 years ago,
first trip to come to the Silicone Valley.

00:12:33.353 --> 00:12:36.303
I was so excited by people.

00:12:36.303 --> 00:12:38.949
Especially, in the evening.

00:12:38.949 --> 00:12:41.758
All the roads, traffic jam.

00:12:41.758 --> 00:12:43.570
I'm excited about that.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:48.021
Especially, Sunday and
Saturday weekends, all the parking lots,

00:12:48.021 --> 00:12:50.257
there is no place to park your car.

00:12:50.257 --> 00:12:51.906
I think this is so exciting.

00:12:51.906 --> 00:12:53.484
China should have that.

00:12:53.484 --> 00:12:58.998
And I go back and, that's right,
now we have a traffic jam.

00:12:58.998 --> 00:13:05.780
[LAUGH]
So we went back to start the business.

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:11.180
Well, and I never know I would
be able to survive for 20 years.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:16.055
So I call myself like a blind man
riding on the back of blind tigers.

00:13:16.055 --> 00:13:20.165
And for 20 years,
survived to today, still surviving.

00:13:20.165 --> 00:13:24.415
We want to make this
company last 102 years.

00:13:24.415 --> 00:13:29.524
So we've finished only 16 years,
there are 86 years to go.

00:13:29.524 --> 00:13:31.265
So I hope that 86 years later.

00:13:31.265 --> 00:13:34.237
&gt;&gt; Explain why 102, so
you started in 1999.

00:13:34.237 --> 00:13:39.646
&gt;&gt; Yeah, because in China, everybody want
to be big company for last 100 years.

00:13:39.646 --> 00:13:41.527
This become a slogan.

00:13:41.527 --> 00:13:42.921
Nobody takes it seriously.

00:13:42.921 --> 00:13:47.430
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; So if you want to give the KPI to

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:51.767
your people, it should be very specific.

00:13:51.767 --> 00:13:55.064
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Then people know this is serious.

00:13:55.064 --> 00:13:58.777
102 years, that a little boy in 1999,
Alibaba, so

00:13:58.777 --> 00:14:03.456
last century we had one year, and
this century we want to have 100 years,

00:14:03.456 --> 00:14:06.970
next century 1 year,
102 across three centuries.

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:12.190
So very specific, so in our company
we never talk your successful or

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:15.960
not, because we think there are 86 years,
next 86 years.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.210
There are many chances that you will fail.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:21.250
So that's why we say don't
talk about you're successful.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:25.180
86 years later we'll talk about it.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:28.444
Well, I think the Seattle
trip was very good, and

00:14:28.444 --> 00:14:33.521
we heard what the American entrepreneurs
and business leaders worry about.

00:14:33.521 --> 00:14:37.960
And I think the American business
leaders also hear what we worry about,

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:38.842
