00:50:33.305 --> 00:50:37.640
Wow, that happens to us, we're lucky.

00:50:39.490 --> 00:50:44.173
&gt;&gt; But I know when I said to myself,
when you have $2 or $3 million,

00:50:44.173 --> 00:50:46.070
