that's why I'm talking everywhere.

00:51:54.000 --> 00:51:57.655
I think of myself CEO,
chief education officer.

00:51:57.655 --> 00:52:00.509
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Try my best to communicate.

00:52:03.480 --> 00:52:07.840
I think China education system,
people say have problem,

00:52:07.840 --> 00:52:12.776
China education is a teaching,
is knowledge, is so good.

00:52:12.776 --> 00:52:13.616
So good.

00:52:15.158 --> 00:52:16.850
Teaching.

00:52:16.850 --> 00:52:19.300
We're the best,
we're not the best in the world.

00:52:19.300 --> 00:52:23.260
Go to any universities,
Chinese students take exams are the best,

00:52:23.260 --> 00:52:24.410
