00:52:47.290 --> 00:52:49.900
The other thing,
the infrastructure of the philanthropy.

00:52:49.900 --> 00:52:55.731
Bill Gates tried to convince me,
with Warren Buffet,

00:52:55.731 --> 00:53:01.960
years ago, came to China,
we should donate every money.

00:53:01.960 --> 00:53:05.980
I asked them, how old are you, Warren?

00:53:08.500 --> 00:53:09.730
He said, 80.

00:53:09.730 --> 00:53:13.280
I said, when I'm 80,
I would donate my money.

00:53:13.280 --> 00:53:15.076
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; I'm only 40.

00:53:15.076 --> 00:53:19.100
What is my philanthropy?

00:53:19.100 --> 00:53:22.111
China, go to Beijing,
Shanghai they are rich places but

00:53:22.111 --> 00:53:23.945
they are only small part of China.

00:53:23.945 --> 00:53:28.450
Go to eastern, the western part of China,
so many poor, terrible places.

00:53:28.450 --> 00:53:33.330
As a business guy, create jobs,
build more business.

00:53:33.330 --> 00:53:37.110
Making sure people have jobs, making
sure people have life good conditions.

00:53:37.110 --> 00:53:37.909
This is the key.

00:53:38.910 --> 00:53:43.480
And the second,
you can donate money to Bill Gates.

00:53:43.480 --> 00:53:45.540
Who should I donate money to?

00:53:45.540 --> 00:53:46.340
Red Cross?

00:53:49.160 --> 00:53:51.520
Who should I give money to?

00:53:51.520 --> 00:53:57.490
Because spending money is more
difficult than making money.

00:53:57.490 --> 00:53:59.480
Especially, for philanthropy.

00:53:59.480 --> 00:54:02.770
When you have a good heart,
you should also have good knowledge and

00:54:02.770 --> 00:54:04.550
