how to do things better.

00:54:28.760 --> 00:54:34.160
I think we also have to work with the
government to make a good policy program,

00:54:34.160 --> 00:54:38.814
so when we build up this infrastructure,
talents and the policy,

00:54:38.814 --> 00:54:40.910
and I think they're coming.

00:54:40.910 --> 00:54:45.352
China philanthropy is coming but
the key is; we need good infrastructure.

00:54:45.352 --> 00:54:47.200
In China, business is good but

00:54:47.200 --> 00:54:51.130
