in ten years, health issues.

00:55:06.270 --> 00:55:11.350
If we don't start to prepare now,
we are going to have a huge problem.

00:55:13.160 --> 00:55:16.740
These are the areas I'm doing that but
unfortunately,

00:55:16.740 --> 00:55:19.570
I don't have plenty of time.

00:55:19.570 --> 00:55:24.710
So we're forming a team, and
I think for philanthropy,

00:55:24.710 --> 00:55:28.688
