if the community is good.

00:56:10.010 --> 00:56:11.900
If the people healthy,
the business will be healthy.

00:56:11.900 --> 00:56:12.640
This is what we believe.

00:56:12.640 --> 00:56:13.570
&gt;&gt; Do you.
