00:59:46.760 --> 00:59:47.770
She said, yeah.

00:59:47.770 --> 00:59:48.750
I said, how do you know about it?

00:59:48.750 --> 00:59:49.570
What do you know about it?

00:59:49.570 --> 00:59:50.850
She said, open sesame.

00:59:50.850 --> 00:59:53.680
I said yeah, that's the name.

00:59:53.680 --> 00:59:57.580
So, I walk on the street asking a lot
