01:00:25.040 --> 01:00:25.970
Or Egypt?

01:00:25.970 --> 01:00:26.830
America Online.

01:00:26.830 --> 01:00:27.890
People, no.

01:00:27.890 --> 01:00:30.792
That Alibaba Online, everybody agree that.

01:00:30.792 --> 01:00:34.740
So, later we bargained,
we got the name from a Canadian guy.

01:00:34.740 --> 01:00:38.990
But I love that name, so
now we also register Alimama.com.

01:00:38.990 --> 01:00:40.840
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Well,

01:00:40.840 --> 01:00:44.760
our motto helps those
nations has small business.

