America because the American
infrastructure of commerce was so good.

01:00:59.760 --> 01:01:02.445
You have a Wal Mart, A Mart,
whatever mart, everywhere.

01:01:02.445 --> 01:01:04.000
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH].

01:01:04.000 --> 01:01:05.430
Cause they don't need it.

01:01:05.430 --> 01:01:06.150
They do.

01:01:06.150 --> 01:01:08.700
But for us, we don't have that.

01:01:08.700 --> 01:01:12.857
So, when internet comes,
we become the main infrastructure.

01:01:12.857 --> 01:01:17.710
And besides that, in America,
