01:01:58.838 --> 01:02:03.960
So villagers,
e-commerce internet grow so fast.

01:02:03.960 --> 01:02:13.180
So, this is why, maybe Indian,
country like Egypt,

01:02:13.180 --> 01:02:18.620
those with good population,
poor infrastructure, young people.

01:02:18.620 --> 01:02:20.335
Your nation has a great young people,
a lot of.

01:02:20.335 --> 01:02:21.780
It's great opportunity.

01:02:21.780 --> 01:02:24.331
We have young people, it's growth.

